> 
> How much time do you think you will need (half day, full day, quarter
> day, etc.) and how many people do you think would be invited for the
> Media workshop?

Full day.

Typically, we have 10-20 people present on the workshops,
although it is hard to tell how many people will be in Asia, as this is
the first time we'll do a workshop there. Informally, many of the
attendants of the previous workshop told me that they intend to go
there. Also, as there are several developers in Korea working with media
development, and we're doing some upstream projects with them, I expect
to have a good number of local participants, but it is a little too soon
to give you a better estimate about how many people will honor it.

